WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.070
Hi, friends.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.694
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:16.800
Hands flat on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.905
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:19.905 --> 00:00:22.493
This is Body Detective.

00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:28.187
Your body sends clues all day long.

00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:34.399
A clue is a signal — it tells you a feeling is here.

00:00:34.399 --> 00:00:38.540
Today we check four clues, quietly, one at a time.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:43.198
First clue — your heart. Put one hand flat on your chest.

00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:49.410
Feel the beat under your hand. Is it fast… or slow and steady?

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:52.516
Fast or slow, both are clues. Just notice.

00:00:52.516 --> 00:00:57.174
Second clue — your hands. Open them wide and look at them.

00:00:57.174 --> 00:01:02.868
Are they squeezed into tight fists… or soft and open?

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:05.974
Tight or soft, both are clues. Just notice.

00:01:05.974 --> 00:01:10.633
Third clue — your belly. Rest one hand on your belly.

00:01:10.633 --> 00:01:16.844
Does it feel fluttery, like butterflies inside? Or calm and still?

00:01:16.844 --> 00:01:19.950
Fluttery or calm, both are clues. Just notice.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.608
Fourth clue — your shoulders. Are they lifted up near your ears?

00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:29.785
Or are they down and soft? Let them drop a little now.

00:01:29.785 --> 00:01:32.890
High or low, both are clues. Just notice.

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:40.137
Four clues. Your body was talking to you — and you listened like a detective.

00:01:40.137 --> 00:01:45.313
A clue is never good or bad. A clue just says: a feeling is here.

00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:51.525
And noticing the clue is the first step. Once you notice, you can name the feeling.

00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:55.666
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:58.772
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:01:58.772 --> 00:02:02.913
You're ready for what's next.
